# .dockerignore — Minimize build context for adp-agent image builds
.git
**/.terraform
**/terraform.tfstate*
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/dist
# Keep modules/agent-factory/agent/src (needed for build)
# Keep modules/agent-factory/agent/package*.json (needed for build)
# Keep modules/agent-factory/agent-worker-image/ (Dockerfile + scripts)
# Keep modules/domain-apps/*/agent/ (personas + skills)
